# Large non-build dirs kept out of the deploy upload. None are part of the web build or
# the serverless functions, so excluding them is safe.
#
# NOTE: this file does NOT affect `vercel dev`'s file watcher. The watcher's filter is
# hardcoded to accept everything; .vercelignore is only read on the deploy-upload path.
# It therefore does not fix the chokidar `spawn EBADF` failure — that needs the large
# directories physically moved out of the project root. See docs/dev-tooling/index.md.
venv/
experiments/

# Not needed for the web build or serverless functions
docs/
ios/
android/
tools/
*.log
